From: SynapseOS
Subject: Skip AppStream metadata generation when cross-building the library

The metainfo generator requires a native AppStream 1.1.2 installation.
The SynapseOS package only exports the target library and headers.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -234,6 +234,8 @@
 subdir('tools/')
 subdir('po/')
-subdir('data/')
+if not meson.is_cross_build()
+    subdir('data/')
+endif
 subdir('contrib/')
 subdir('docs/')
 subdir('tests/')
